    "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Greenlight</h1><p>Hi guys, we need your help, we are putting the game up for visibility, and the more you can spread, the more support we will have, we are a small development group and for everything to work out, we need your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>We are game developers from Brazil\r\nHello everyone, we are creating an immersive game set in the time of the Black Death.\r\n\r\nThe player will have to solve puzzles, run from enemies, destroy parts of the scenario to progress in the game. The main thing in the game is to try to generate new emotions and make the Player immersed in this medieval environment and with a dangerous disease spreading.\r\nThe game tries to show what a supposed onset of the disease would be like in a gamified way, placing it as supernatural facts.\r\n\r\nDeath or objects related to it are just information without eschatology.\r\n\r\nThe content already created is related to the onset of the disease.\r\n\r\nThe character's personal goal is to try to find a cure for his child who will get sick in the game.\r\n\r\nThe protagonist needs to get the cure so that this disease stops and does not spread further.",
    "about_the_game": "We are game developers from Brazil<br />\r\nHello everyone, we are creating an immersive game set in the time of the Black Death.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player will have to solve puzzles, run from enemies, destroy parts of the scenario to progress in the game. The main thing in the game is to try to generate new emotions and make the Player immersed in this medieval environment and with a dangerous disease spreading.<br />\r\nThe game tries to show what a supposed onset of the disease would be like in a gamified way, placing it as supernatural facts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeath or objects related to it are just information without eschatology.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe content already created is related to the onset of the disease.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe character's personal goal is to try to find a cure for his child who will get sick in the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe protagonist needs to get the cure so that this disease stops and does not spread further.",
    "short_description": "An action, adventure and musical game. Perfect for hanging out and having fun.",
